在当前 Profile 的 `package.json` (通常位于 `~/.dsh/profiles/desktop/package.json`) 中声明依赖并加入 bundle：

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "dsh-crash-guard": "^1.0.0"
  },

若引用 GitHub 仓库版本：
```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "dsh-crash-guard": "github:zxzc114514/dsh-crash-guard#v1.0.0"
  }

---

Declare the dependency in your profile `package.json` (typically at `~/.dsh/profiles/desktop/package.json`):

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "dsh-crash-guard": "^1.0.0"
  },

Or targeting the GitHub tag:
```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "dsh-crash-guard": "github:zxzc114514/dsh-crash-guard#v1.0.0"
  }

---
